{
  "_comment": "Tres sites, tres targets EXPLICITOS. 'site' preserva a landing principal, 'enamed' publica somente dist/enamed e 'parceiros' publica somente parceiros/public. Nenhum bloco faz deploy de Cloud Functions; os rewrites apenas consomem Functions administradas pelo repositorio do app.",
  "hosting": [
    {
      "target": "site",
      "public": "dist/site",
      "predeploy": [
        "node scripts/guard-site-deploy.mjs",
        "node scripts/build-site.mjs --verify"
      ],
      "ignore": [
        "firebase.json",
        "**/.*",
        "**/node_modules/**",
        "package.json",
        "package-lock.json",
        "DEPLOY-CONFIG-README.md",
        "*.log",
        "firebase-debug.log",
        "firestore-debug.log",
        "ui-debug.log",
        "skills-lock.json",
        "dist/**",
        "scripts/**",
        "enamed/**",
        "parceiros/**",
        "qa-*.png"
      ],
      "rewrites": [
        {
          "source": "/_consent/reference",
          "function": "issueMarketingConsentReference"
        },
        {
          "source": "/_bridge/appstore-click",
          "function": "recordAppStoreClick"
        }
      ],
      "headers": [
        {
          "source": "**/*.html",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "regex": "^(?:/.*)?/$",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "no-cache, max-age=0, must-revalidate"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "**/*.@(css|js)",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "public, max-age=3600, must-revalidate"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "**/*.@(png|jpg|jpeg|webp|avif|gif|svg|ico)",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "public, max-age=86400"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "**/*.@(woff|woff2|ttf|otf)",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "public, max-age=86400"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "enamed",
      "public": "dist/enamed",
      "ignore": [
        "**/.*",
        "**/node_modules/**"
      ],
      "cleanUrls": false,
      "trailingSlashBehavior": "ADD",
      "headers": [
        {
          "source": "**",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Content-Security-Policy",
              "value": "default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://connect.facebook.net; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https://www.facebook.com; media-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://www.facebook.com https://connect.facebook.net; frame-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'",
              "_comment": "connect-src sem nenhuma origem de teste. O preview usa um arquivo de configuracao PROPRIO (firebase.preview.json), entao este CSP nunca precisa acomodar staging. As chamadas de producao sao same-origin, resolvidas pelos rewrites abaixo."
            },
            {
              "key": "X-Content-Type-Options",
              "value": "nosniff"
            },
            {
              "key": "X-Frame-Options",
              "value": "DENY"
            },
            {
              "key": "Referrer-Policy",
              "value": "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
            },
            {
              "key": "Permissions-Policy",
              "value": "camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()"
            },
            {
              "key": "Strict-Transport-Security",
              "value": "max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains"
            },
            {
              "key": "Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy",
              "value": "same-origin"
            },
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "**/*.html",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "/release-manifest.json",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "**/*.@(css|js)",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "no-cache, must-revalidate",
              "_comment": "no-cache, nao max-age=3600. Estes arquivos carregam a logica de CONSENTIMENTO e as datas da campanha. Uma hora de cache cego significa uma hora em que uma correcao de consentimento nao chega a quem ja visitou — e foi exatamente isso que mascarou um defeito durante o QA: o navegador executava a versao antiga enquanto o servidor ja servia a nova. `no-cache` revalida sempre; o corpo so trafega se mudou. Imagens, video e fontes seguem `immutable`, que e onde o peso realmente esta (6,9 MB contra ~30 KB de JS)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "**/*.@(png|jpg|jpeg|webp|avif|gif|svg|ico|mp4)",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "**/*.@(woff|woff2|ttf|otf)",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "_comment": "Rewrites same-origin para as Functions de PRODUCAO. Um rewrite de Hosting so alcanca Functions do MESMO projeto Firebase (auscultoapp), por isso o preview NAO os usa: la o script chama as URLs HTTPS diretas do projeto de staging, escolhidas em runtime pelo hostname (ver resolveEndpoints em meta_tracking.js). Em producao estes rewrites eliminam CORS e mantem o connect-src restrito ao proprio dominio.",
      "rewrites": [
        {
          "source": "/_consent/reference",
          "function": "issueMarketingConsentReference"
        },
        {
          "source": "/_bridge/appstore-click",
          "function": "recordAppStoreClick"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "parceiros",
      "public": "parceiros/public",
      "ignore": [
        "firebase.json",
        "**/.*",
        "**/node_modules/**"
      ],
      "rewrites": [
        {
          "source": "/r/**",
          "function": "partnerLinkRedirect",
          "region": "us-central1"
        },
        {
          "source": "**",
          "destination": "/index.html"
        }
      ],
      "headers": [
        {
          "source": "**",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "X-Frame-Options",
              "value": "DENY"
            },
            {
              "key": "X-Content-Type-Options",
              "value": "nosniff"
            },
            {
              "key": "Referrer-Policy",
              "value": "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
            },
            {
              "key": "Permissions-Policy",
              "value": "camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()"
            },
            {
              "key": "X-Robots-Tag",
              "value": "noindex, nofollow, noarchive"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "@(index.html|app.js|config.js|coupon_ui.js|styles.css)",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "**/*.@(png|jpg|jpeg|svg|webp|woff|woff2)",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "public, max-age=86400, must-revalidate"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
